cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PLANTORV, please cite the paper below. PLANTORV is the vision
  component of the PLANTOR planning framework; if you also use PLANTOR,
  please cite the PLANTOR paper listed under references as well.
title: >-
  PLANTORV: PLanning with Natural language for Task-Oriented Robots with Vision
